sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): n/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EnergyTransferStarted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to reboot the charging EVSE with status OnIdle

    CSMS->>CS: ResetRequest (status OnIdle, evseID = <Configured evseId>)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: Message ResetRequest<br>- type OnIdle<br>- evseId <Configured evseId>
    CS-->>CSMS: ResetResponse (status = Scheduled)

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Updated, triggerReason = StopAuthorized, transactionInfo.chargingState = EVConnected, idToken.idToken = <Configured valid_idtoken_idtoken>, idToken.type = <Configured valid_idtoken_type>)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Ended, triggerReason = EVCommunicationLost, transactionInfo.chargingState = Idle, transactionInfo.stoppedReason = EVDisconnected)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
